Package: citrate-node
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libssl3, libc6 (>= 2.31)
Suggests: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Maintainer: Citrate AI <engineering@citrate.ai>
Description: Citrate AI-native Layer-1 blockchain node
 Citrate is an AI-native Layer-1 BlockDAG blockchain using GhostDAG
 consensus, paired with an EVM-compatible execution environment and
 a standardized Model Context Protocol (MCP) layer. This package
 installs the citrate-node daemon and systemd service unit.
Homepage: https://citrate.ai
